  <section class="ab2-section ab2-section--bg">
    <div class="ab2-wrap--mid">
      <div class="ab2-anim">
        <span class="ab2-eyebrow">Common questions</span>
        <h2 class="ab2-h2">Everything You Need to Know Before You Order</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ab2-faq ab2-anim">
        <div class="ab2-faq__item">
          <div class="ab2-faq__q">Do I need any special tools?</div>
          <div class="ab2-faq__a">
            Just a standard residential power drill. The drill bit, screws, and all hardware are included in the kit. No
            circular saw, miter saw, level, or tape measure required.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ab2-faq__item">
          <div class="ab2-faq__q">How long does the build actually take?</div>
          <div class="ab2-faq__a">
            Most customers complete their deck in one day. Some smaller configurations take just a few hours. There is
            no multi-day or multi-weekend commitment.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ab2-faq__item">
          <div class="ab2-faq__q">I've never built anything before. Is this really doable?</div>
          <div class="ab2-faq__a">
            Yes. The system was designed specifically for people without construction experience. The 3D visual
            instructions guide you through every single connection. Customers with zero building background complete
            their decks successfully every week.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ab2-faq__item">
          <div class="ab2-faq__q">What exactly arrives in the crate?</div>
          <div class="ab2-faq__a">
            Everything. Grade 1 kiln-dried pressure-treated lumber (pre-cut and labeled), all galvanized screws and
            hardware, TuffBlock deck foundations, a custom drill bit, and a full 3D assembly guide. You will not need to
            make a single trip to a lumber yard or hardware store.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ab2-faq__item">
          <div class="ab2-faq__q">Can I customize the size or add railings and stairs?</div>
          <div class="ab2-faq__a">
            Yes. Kits are available in eight standard sizes from 12×12 to 16×28. You can add railings, stairs, and
            choose your foundation type. The modular design also allows you to combine multiple kits for larger or
            custom-shaped builds.
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ab2-faq__item">
          <div class="ab2-faq__q">Is the structural quality comparable to a contractor-built deck?</div>
          <div class="ab2-faq__a">
            Yes. The materials are Grade 1 kiln-dried, pressure-treated lumber with 6×6 beams, 2×8 joists at 13–14
            inches on center, and galvanized hardware throughout. The system is engineered to residential code and
            supports over 15,000 lbs of load.
